[[File:SepSupplyShip2-POD.png|thumb|right|250px|A DH-Omni Support Vessel over [[Umbara]]]]
A '''supply ship''' was a type of [[starship]] that served as a type of support vessel. The [[Dual Hemisphere-Omni Support Vessel]] was a class of supply ship used by the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Starfighters">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia of Starfighters and Other Vehicles]]''</ref> The [[Spectres]] rebel cell conducted a series of [[raiding missions on Imperial supply ships]] during the [[early rebellion against the Galactic Empire]] that bolstered the young rebel cause and resulted in losses amongst the Empire's supply lines.<ref name="Ghost Raid">{{SW|url=games-apps/star-wars-rebels-ghost-raid|text=''Star Wars Rebels: Ghost Raid''|int=Star Wars Rebels: Ghost Raid|nolive=1}}</ref>

